# Motion: the screen moves while something glides and does nothing once it has landed; Setup's MOTION still lands
# every move at once; the setting is the FM-1's, kept when a project loads and over a restart
wait 300
expect theme 3
expect still 0
# the autosave redraws the header when it runs, an unrelated change: off, so nothing but motion moves the screen
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row AUTOSAVE
turn ALGO -1
tap HOME
tap EDIT
settle
changes 300 0 0
turn K1 20
changes 120 2 100
settle
changes 400 0 0
# a SEL list: the pill glides to the row picked, then the screen is quiet
tap SEL
settle
turn SELECT 1
changes 100 1 100
settle
changes 400 0 0
turn SELECT -1
changes 100 1 100
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# a page change fades up and rises in (the screen changes while it does), then the screen is quiet
settle
tap FX
changes 100 6 400
settle
changes 400 0 0
# a toast: the header drops in and fades up, holds still, and fades back up when the toast ends
tap HOME
settle
tap OCT+
changes 100 2 100
wait 100
changes 200 0 0
wait 1500
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap OCT-
wait 1500
settle
# a track change crossfades the inks, then the screen is quiet
tap EDIT
settle
spin ALGO 1
changes 100 10 400
settle
changes 400 0 0
# pictures that rest: the LFO's curve, a chorus's picture and the Master page's scope draw nothing while no sound plays ...
knob 2 ltype wave
knob 2 ldest synth
knob 2 lamt 100
knob 2 lspeed 40
knob 3 ltype wave
knob 3 ldest synth
knob 3 lamt 100
knob 3 lspeed 40
knob 11 engine chorus
tap LFO
expect page LFO
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap FX
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page FX_I
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
expect page Master_EQ
settle
changes 400 0 0
# ... and move while a song plays: the LFO's curve scrolls, the chorus's pictures turn, the scope draws the sound
tap SEQ
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
tapkey w8
tapkey w12
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 700
tap LFO
changes 400 20 2000
tap FX
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
changes 400 20 2000
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
changes 400 10 2000
# the song stops: the scope and the pictures come to rest once the tail is quiet
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# MOTION still: a turned knob and a picked row land at once
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
expect page Setup
tap SEL
row MOTION
turn ALGO 1
expect still 1
tap HOME
tap EDIT
settle
turn K1 -20
changes 100 0 1
changes 400 0 0
tap SEL
settle
turn SELECT 1
changes 100 0 1
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# ... and so are a page change, a toast and a track change
settle
tap FX
changes 100 0 0
tap HOME
settle
tap OCT+
changes 100 0 0
wait 1500
settle
tap OCT-
wait 1500
settle
tap EDIT
settle
spin ALGO 1
changes 100 0 8
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# ... and a song playing: the Steps page redraws as the playhead moves (an eighth of a second a step) and does no more,
# the LFO's curve and the chorus's pictures hold (at most the header's small activity dot moves), the Master page
# draws no scope; once the song stops every one of them is quiet
tap SEQ
tap PLAY
expect playing 1
wait 700
changes 1000 8 120
tap LFO
changes 400 0 8
tap FX
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page FX_I
changes 400 0 8
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
expect page Master_EQ
changes 400 0 0
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
tap LFO
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap FX
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 1
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
settle
changes 400 0 0
tap HOME
# the setting is the FM-1's: kept when project 1 loads, over a restart and by a new project
projsave 1
tap HOME
tap SEL
row LOAD PROJECT
tap SEL
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 300
expect still 1
reboot
wait 400
expect still 1
projnew
expect still 1
